COMMENT ON COLUMN UNIPOST_ENTITY_TYPES.is_composite IS
'Flag denoting whether this entity type is a virtual read-only composite entity synthesizing multiple base entity types';

COMMENT ON COLUMN UNIPOST_ENTITY_TYPES.composite_spec IS
'Declarative JSON AST specifying root base entity, child joins (Pattern B foreign key or Pattern C association), field projections, and aliases';
